 brought to the code and the user's decisions of 2026-11-19 (the beta/live
 site, pre-launch mode, the guest, the free plan's whole ticker list, outbox
 30 days, forgot kept, one Terminal quota, the restricted-plan rule, the
 gateway expiry, M260), the fix-round tracks' builds marked built or to build,
 the clauses the code no longer follows (R1-6, R2-41), rollback floors (R2-6),
 the account-deletion procedure (R2-27) and the recipients of personal data
 (R2-28), the last two held by tests against the migrations and the pages

